Radar is a multi-licence repository of the Libre AI project.

The licence for each file is declared through SPDX metadata and REUSE.toml:

- EUPL-1.2: the Rust application workspace, the UI surface, the PostgreSQL
  migrations, the database security manifest, the scripts, the end-to-end suite,
  the agent-context configuration and the workflows under `.github/` —
  first-party software and runtime policy by default;
- Apache-2.0: the interoperability schemas under `schemas/` and the sample
  corpus under `examples/`;
- CC-BY-4.0: editorial documentation and first-party project records.

Full licence texts are stored in LICENSES/.

The organization-wide licensing policy — scope, precedence, historical grants,
data and contribution rules — is the canonical one and is not restated here:
https://github.com/libre-ai/libre-ai/blob/main/LICENSING.md

Historical revisions previously published under MIT remain available under
those terms. No previous licence grant is withdrawn.
